    "magenta transversal line containing R2, R3, and R4 and extending toward R1 at infinity",
    "black points R2, R3, and R4 on the R line with serif labels",
    "label R1 with right-pointing arrow to infinity symbol",
    "visual indication that the R line is parallel to the lower projection ray, making R1 a point at infinity",
